1
00:00:00,305 --> 00:00:02,535
(Emily:)you'd want to come over?

2
00:00:05,544 --> 00:00:09,084
(Raj:)I'm sorry, I don't think
that's a good idea.

3
00:00:09,081 --> 00:00:11,151
(Emily:)Okay. I'm just...

4
00:00:11,149 --> 00:00:12,619
(crying):
I'm having a really hard time,

5
00:00:12,618 --> 00:00:15,388
(Emily:)but that's not your problem,
that's mine.

6
00:00:15,387 --> 00:00:17,287
I-I won't bother you again,

7
00:00:17,289 --> 00:00:21,429
(Emily:)but please know that you'll
always have a place in my heart.

8
00:00:26,465 --> 00:00:27,765
(Emily:)Bye, Raj.

9
00:00:27,766 --> 00:00:30,096
(Emily:)You're a good guy.

10
00:00:30,102 --> 00:00:32,402
(Raj:)Good-bye, Emily.

11
00:00:33,972 --> 00:00:36,372
(sighs):
That was rough, you guys.

12
00:00:36,375 --> 00:00:38,245
(Penny:)I know, but you did it.
I'm so proud of you.

13
00:00:38,243 --> 00:00:40,873
(Raj:)Well, anyway, I'll leave you
to your girls' night.

14
00:00:40,879 --> 00:00:42,779
(Amy:)Are you sure you don't want
to stay here with us?

15
00:00:42,781 --> 00:00:44,781
(Raj:)No, I kind of feel like
being alone right now.

16
00:00:44,783 --> 00:00:46,783
(Bernadette:)Well, if you change your mind,
we'll be here.

17
00:00:46,785 --> 00:00:48,715
(Leonard:)Thank you.

18
00:00:48,720 --> 00:00:50,590
(Penny:)Say hi to Emily for us.

19
00:00:50,589 --> 00:00:52,759
(Raj:)Will do.

20
00:00:58,049 --> 00:01:00,479
(Howard:)This contract
looks good to me.

